1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr></table></div></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:center"><span><br/></span></div><div id="id148cf8365b645fe87a632025dced47d_52"></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">6.&#160;&#160;  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock" id="f-561" continuedAt="f-561-1" escape="true">LEASES</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><ix:continuation id="f-561-1" continuedAt="f-561-2"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company has operating leases for corporate office space and certain equipment. The leases have original terms from <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-156" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="f-562">one year</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-157" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="f-563">ten years</ix:nonNumeric>, some of which include options to renew the lease, and are included in the lease term when it is reasonably certain that the Company will exercise the option. No leases include options to purchase the leased property. Our lease agreements do not contain any material residual value guarantees or material restrictive covenants. We do not have any lease agreements with related parties. </span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:LeaseCostTableTextBlock" id="f-564" continuedAt="f-564-1" escape="true"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The components of lease cost were as follows (in